"desc": "Interrupt on Delay.   0 - No Delay Interrupt.   1 - Delay Interrupt detected. If enabled (DMACR.DlyCnt_IrqEn = 1), an interrupt out is generated when the delay count reaches its programmed value.
",
"enum_values": "",
"lsb": "",
